-- src/data/nflConnectionsPuzzles.ts and src/data/nhlConnectionsPuzzles.ts.
-- Same puzzle_id, same sort_order, same row count, so dailyIndex deals the
-- same board on the same day and nothing reshuffles. Only groups_json changes.
--
-- Why: the checker (scripts/simUsConnectionsFacts.mjs, the shared cross check
-- with each sport's record) found 125 findings and 5 watched men on 33 of the
-- 60 baseball boards: false members (Alex Rodriguez, Barry Bonds and Albert
