-- (Goose and Rich Gossage on bconn-049), and men about to join a group beside
-- them. On the NFL side Le'Veon Bell sat in nflconn-004's Steelers group beside
-- its Ravens group (five games for Baltimore in 2021); on the NHL side Erik
-- Karlsson and Brent Burns, 947 and 948 career points and still playing, sat
-- beside "1,000+ career points" on nhlconn-004. The round's review added one
-- baseball board the checker leaves unknown: Rollie Fingers sat in bconn-029's
-- "Oakland Athletics legends" beside "Milwaukee Brewers legends", and the
-- Brewers retired his 34, so Jose Canseco takes his place; and bconn-021's
-- "Los Angeles Dodgers legends" held Jackie Robinson, who played only in
